he","Francés e italiano"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Bern es un cantón bilingüe alemán-francés. La lengua del entorno concreto depende de la región.","source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/language","source_title":"DFAE · Cantones multilingües","reviewed_at":"2026-11-12","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published"},"known":["00993f4a92e0f57efb7f56d5540b4233"]},{"question":{"id":"so-libero","category":"sociedad","difficulty":2,"scope":"canton","canton":"SO","language":"es","prompt":"En la región de Solothurn cubierta por su red, ¿qué comunidad tarifaria permite consultar títulos y zonas?","options":["Libero","Mobilis","Unireso","Arcobaleno"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Libero cubre regiones de Bern y Solothurn. No debe asumirse su validez fuera de las zonas correspondientes.","source_url":"https://www.bernmobil.ch/de/abos-tickets/libero-tarifverbund","source_title":"BERNMOBIL · Libero","reviewed_at":"2026-11-12","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published"},"known":["ead8422f7bf9d28b187b9b4a59494f94"]},{"question":{"id":"vd-mobilis","category":"sociedad","difficulty":2,"scope":"canton","canton":"VD","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué nombre recibe la comunidad tarifaria que cubre gran parte del cantón de Vaud?","options":["Mobilis","Passepartout","Unireso","ZVV"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Mobilis organiza una tarifa por zonas para gran parte del cantón de Vaud.","source_url":"https://www.vd.ch/mobilite/loffre-de-mobilite-a-votre-disposition/communautes-tarifaires","source_title":"État de Vaud · Comunidades tarifarias","reviewed_at":"2026-11-12","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published"},"known":["22f8f08072b4a35fc0e6d193779669a7"]},{"question":{"id":"vd-mobilis-zonas","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"scope":"canton","canton":"VD","language":"es","prompt":"¿En qué se basa principalmente la lógica tarifaria de Mobilis?","options":["En las zonas elegidas y la validez del título","Solo la distancia en línea recta","Solo el número de v