":"administracion","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"language":"es","prompt":"Una consulta sobre la escuela y otra sobre una ley federal pueden corresponder a autoridades diferentes.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El federalismo reparte competencias: una misma persona puede necesitar información de varios niveles para asuntos diferentes.","source_url":"https://www.ch-info.swiss/en/die-schweiz/foederalismus","source_title":"Cancillería Federal · Federalismo","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["8f7b842fbfa3ba2f29b151c5b2f21c26","cdcaf986ef886150b51376b90f71175c","fda6d9c6ce91aabf55da84853fda5355"]},{"question":{"id":"game-tf-5-1","category":"vivienda","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"language":"es","prompt":"Si todos firmáis el contrato del piso, basta con repartir la renta para que cada uno responda solo de su parte.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Si todos figuráis como inquilinos en el mismo contrato, respondéis conjuntamente de la renta. Repartir los pagos entre vosotros no cambia por sí solo esa responsabilidad.","source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","source_title":"ch.ch · Contratos de alquiler","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["45fe7036992b8992c87e5054e201243a","97878c6bb0a3c137c6261908474b06eb","3d9b92d0730f269ee78401ec8bf97619"]},{"question":{"id":"game-tf-5-2","category":"trabajo","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"language":"es","prompt":"Al comparar empleos cuentan también la jornada, las vacaciones y las condiciones del contrato.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Para comparar empleos hay que considerar la remuneración junto con las condiciones del trabajo.","source_url":"https://www.kmu.admin.ch/en/the-purpose-of-the-employment-contract","source_title":"SECO · El contrato de trabajo","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["7d51cad6b486577897bb85981676ab5e","2d0cc88fe8f7c4ee168dd25313bc2428","ac0ef686e0a2f12d82a395e9514cf8a1"]},{"question":{"id":"game-tf-5-3","category":"salud","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"language":"es","prompt":"Al elegir seguro, basta con comparar la prima: una franquicia más alta reduce siempre cualquier coste total.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"La elección debe tener en cuenta tanto el pago periódico como los gastos que puedes asumir cuando recibes prestaciones.","source_url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","source_title":"BAG · Primas y participación en gastos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published","game_type":"tf","game_only":true},"known":["051e5dc368c7d439b8867632e9a86110","fe4a17c07e43194bf706c0f76a13b414","c122ad318557828b430c586504dc7ec7"]},{"question":{"id":"game-tf-5-4","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"language":"es","prompt":"Un abono suizo puede dejar de ser válido antes de llegar a tu destino en el extranjero.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El mapa y las condiciones del título permiten identificar qué tramos están cubiertos y cuáles requieren otra solución.","source_url":"https://www.sbb.ch/en/tickets-offers/travelcards/area-validity-map.html","source_title":"SBB · Ámbito de validez de títulos de transporte","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["b61307338a42780dfee0cc5322f590b9","fbad77ff1d7674192cc1405f9fc79c00","94400b0cef306aa8bd5cc4c823655b29"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-residuo-individual-2026","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Desde agosto de 2026, una persona adulta tira una sola bolsa de plástico vacía a la calle. ¿Qué multa ordinaria corresponde a ese residuo individual?","options":["80 CHF","100 CHF","150 CHF","250 CHF"],"explanation":"Una bolsa vacía individual se encuadra como pequeño residuo: 80 CHF. Una bolsa llena de basura se valora de otra manera, según su contenido y volumen. La cifra se refiere al procedimiento de multa ordinaria, no a cualquier caso de vertido.","sources":[{"id":"ch-litter-2026","url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/VaJjizZsf40B/Faktenblatt%20Abfall%20-%20Schweizweit%20einheitliche%20Littering-Busse.pdf","title":"BAFU · Faktenblatt: Schweizweit einheitliche Littering-Busse, agosto de 2026","authority":"Bundesamt für Umwelt BAFU","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Páginas 1–3; tabla 1; OBV, anexo 2, apartado 9003"}],"source_url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/VaJjizZsf40B/Faktenblatt%20Abfall%20-%20Schweizweit%20einheitliche%20Littering-Busse.pdf","source_title":"BAFU · Faktenblatt: Schweizweit einheitliche Littering-Busse, agosto de 2026","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-01-15","concept_id":"CH:residuo-individual-2026","status":"published","effective_from":"2026-08-01","validity_year":2026,"editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0},"known":["42d953396c3c62019d2521d9a979f234"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-littering-volumen-parejas","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"Une cada cantidad de basura abandonada con su multa federal ordinaria, vigente desde agosto de 2026.","options":["Un pequeño residuo individual","Varios residuos: menos de 17 litros","Desde 17 hasta 35 litros","Más de 35 y hasta 110 litros"],"explanation":"No confundas una pieza de basura con una bolsa llena. La tabla federal distingue cantidad y volumen; fuera del supuesto de multa ordinaria puede abrirse un procedimiento penal.","sources":[{"id":"ch-litter-2026","url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/VaJjizZsf40B/Faktenblatt%20Abfall%20-%20Schweizweit%20einheitliche%20Littering-Busse.pdf","title":"BAFU · Faktenblatt: Schweizweit einheitliche Littering-Busse, agosto de 2026","authority":"Bundesamt für Umwelt BAFU","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Páginas 1–3; tabla 1; OBV, anexo 2, apartado 9003"}],"source_url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/VaJjizZsf40B/Faktenblatt%20Abfall%20-%20Schweizweit%20einheitliche%20Littering-Busse.pdf","source_title":"BAFU · Faktenblatt: Schweizweit einheitliche Littering-Busse, agosto de 2026","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-01-15","concept_id":"CH:littering-volumen-parejas","status":"published","effective_from":"2026-08-01","validity_year":2026,"editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"pairs":["80 CHF","100 CHF","150 CHF","250 CHF"],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["f71c1d76d8d5e7b493d37612bc5954ca"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-foto-persona-reconocible","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Quieres publicar en Latido el retrato de una vecina que has fotografiado en la calle. No hay un interés público especial. ¿Qué debes hacer?","options":["Pedirle consentimiento informado para publicarlo","Publicarlo: estar en la calle ya autoriza su uso","Publicarlo si ocultas el nombre, aunque se reconozca","Publicarlo sin preguntar si no cobras por la foto"],"explanation":"Que una persona esté en la calle no elimina su derecho a la imagen. Para un retrato reconocible, la regla es obtener consentimiento para el contexto de publicación. Existen excepciones, por ejemplo por un interés prevalente, que aquí no se plantean.","sources":[{"id":"ch-photo-privacy","url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/en/photos-and-privacy","title":"FDPIC · Photos and privacy","authority":"Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Consent requirements; Legally valid consent; Tips for photographers"}],"source_url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/en/photos-and-privacy","source_title":"FDPIC · Photos and privacy","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:foto-persona-reconocible","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["278537d3299895ce73691daab6a3a336"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-foto-grupal-permiso","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"Vas a publicar una foto de grupo de un encuentro vecinal. ¿Qué afirmaciones son correctas?","options":["Hay que informar de cómo y dónde se publicará","Si una persona del grupo se opone, no debe publicarse esa foto con ella","Una foto de grupo nunca contiene datos personales","Una autorización inicial permite cualquier uso futuro para siempre"],"explanation":"También una fotografía de grupo puede permitir identificar personas. La información previa y la oposición de alguien retratado importan. El consentimiento no se convierte en una autorización ilimitada e irrevocable.","sources":[{"id":"ch-photo-privacy","url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/en/photos-and-privacy","title":"FDPIC · Photos and privacy","authority":"Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Consent requirements; Legally valid consent; Tips for photographers"}],"source_url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/en/photos-and-privacy","source_title":"FDPIC · Photos and privacy","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:foto-grupal-permiso","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1],"correct_index":0},"known":["da74c571e3a8ec6654ec8df0e540ec39"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-foto-turistica-transeunte","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"Publicar una foto turística tomada abiertamente exige siempre el permiso de cada transeúnte que salga de forma accesoria.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"No siempre. El PFPDT distingue los retratos de personas de quienes aparecen de forma accesoria ante un monumento. En este último supuesto contempla una excepción, pero debe atenderse una oposición y, cuando proceda, retirar la imagen.","sources":[{"id":"ch-photo-privacy","url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/en/photos-and-privacy","title":"FDPIC · Photos and privacy","authority":"Federal Data Protection and Information Commissioner","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Consent requirements; Legally valid consent; Tips for photographers"}],"source_url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/en/photos-and-privacy","source_title":"FDPIC · Photos and privacy","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:foto-turistica-transeunte","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["b3e2a70f122aed47983e0baf4f0cb98e"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-seguro-componentes-gasto","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"Relaciona cada término del seguro básico con su significado.","options":["Prima","Franquicia","Participación porcentual habitual","Contribución hospitalaria"],"explanation":"La prima no sustituye la participación en los gastos. La contribución hospitalaria es un concepto adicional y existen personas y prestaciones exentas.","sources":[{"id":"ch-healthcost","url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","title":"BAG · Health insurance: premiums and co-payment","authority":"Bundesamt für Gesundheit","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Co-payment y FAQ cost sharing"}],"source_url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","source_title":"BAG · Health insurance: premiums and co-payment","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:seguro-componentes-gasto","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"pairs":["Pago periódico por el seguro","Importe anual inicial antes del copago","Porcentaje de ciertos costes tras la franquicia","Pago diario por ingreso, con exenciones"],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["0e088e409b31ed6a86dcb021b088447c"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-seguro-franquicia-menores","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"Un menor de 18 años sin franquicia optativa no paga la franquicia ordinaria de 300 CHF de los adultos.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"Los menores no tienen franquicia ordinaria, aunque se puede contratar una optativa. Esto no significa que cualquier atención sea gratuita: puede existir participación porcentual y hay reglas especiales según la prestación.","sources":[{"id":"ch-healthcost","url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","title":"BAG · Health insurance: premiums and co-payment","authority":"Bundesamt für Gesundheit","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Co-payment y FAQ cost sharing"}],"source_url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","source_title":"BAG · Health insurance: premiums and co-payment","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:seguro-franquicia-menores","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["6a8f9a9b91d0ac0dff146a277af22309"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-subarriendo-motivos","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"¿En qué casos puede justificarse rechazar un subarriendo según la información federal?","options":["No se comunican sus condiciones al arrendador","Se exige un alquiler de subarriendo abusivamente elevado","Provoca una desventaja importante para el arrendador","El arrendador lo rechaza únicamente porque cualquier subarriendo está prohibido en Suiza"],"explanation":"El subarriendo no está prohibido de manera general. Deben comunicarse sus condiciones y respetarse los límites legales; ocultarlas, un precio abusivo o una desventaja importante pueden justificar el rechazo.","sources":[{"id":"ch-rental","url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","authority":"Schweizerische Bundeskanzlei","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Concluding; What else; Disputes; Subletting"}],"source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","source_title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:subarriendo-motivos","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1,2],"correct_index":0},"known":["4938139be3e9e38938c3baea09d7be8d"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-gastos-alquiler-contrato","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En tu contrato de alquiler no se mencionan gastos accesorios separados. ¿Qué indica ch.ch?","options":["Se consideran incluidos en la renta","Se cobran después aunque no se hayan pactado","Se consideran siempre gastos a repartir con los vecinos","Solo se incluyen si tienes un seguro del hogar"],"explanation":"La información federal explica que, si no se han mencionado aparte en el contrato, puede entenderse que esos gastos están incluidos en el alquiler. Conviene revisar la cláusula exacta antes de aceptar un cobro separado.","sources":[{"id":"ch-rental","url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","authority":"Schweizerische Bundeskanzlei","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Concluding; What else; Disputes; Subletting"}],"source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","source_title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:gastos-alquiler-contrato","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["fae0ad747d9126256a0bf96f847400e9"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-idiomas-nombres","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"idioma","category":"idioma","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"Une cada lengua nacional con su nombre en español.","options":["Deutsch","Français","Italiano","Rumantsch"],"explanation":"Las cuatro son lenguas nacionales de Suiza. El estatus de una lengua en la Confederación y su uso oficial en un cantón no son exactamente lo mismo.","sources":[{"id":"ch-languages","url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/language","title":"DFAE · Language","authority":"Federal Department of Foreign Affairs","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Facts and figures on languages in Switzerland"}],"source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/language","source_title":"DFAE · Language","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:idiomas-nombres","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"pairs":["Alemán","Francés","Italiano","Romanche"],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["fb9362414076e91f5a436cef024599d4"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-italiano-fuera-ticino","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"En Suiza también se habla italiano en algunas zonas de Graubünden.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"La Suiza de habla italiana no se limita a Ticino: incluye valles de Graubünden. Esto no significa que todo Graubünden sea italófono.","sources":[{"id":"ch-languages","url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/language","title":"DFAE · Language","authority":"Federal Department of Foreign Affairs","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Facts and figures on languages in Switzerland"}],"source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/language","source_title":"DFAE · Language","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:italiano-fuera-ticino","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["1981b27210bc10a68a57d56fa7337ed4"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-geografia-relaciones","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"Une cada lugar o río suizo con su pista.","options":["Dufourspitze","Lago Maggiore","Río Ticino","Río Inn"],"explanation":"La geografía suiza conecta distintas cuencas europeas. El Ticino desemboca en el Po y el Inn en el Danubio; la cumbre máxima no es el Matterhorn.","sources":[{"id":"ch-geography","url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/geography","title":"DFAE · Geography","authority":"Federal Department of Foreign Affairs","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Geography – facts and figures"}],"source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/geography","source_title":"DFAE · Geography","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:geografia-relaciones","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"pairs":["Cumbre más alta de Suiza","Zona del punto de menor altitud del país","Afluente del Po","Afluente del Danubio"],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["fd85c551e7dd96432350f4dacad3dc1c"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-franquicias-orden","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"order","prompt":"Ordena estas franquicias anuales para adultos de menor a mayor.","options":["2500 CHF","300 CHF","1000 CHF","500 CHF"],"explanation":"La franquicia ordinaria de adultos es 300 CHF. Entre las optativas figuran 500, 1000 y 2500 CHF; también existen otras cuantías. Una franquicia más alta aumenta el riesgo económico asumido.","sources":[{"id":"ch-healthcost","url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","title":"BAG · Health insurance: premiums and co-payment","authority":"Bundesamt für Gesundheit","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Co-payment y FAQ cost sharing"}],"source_url":"https://www.bag.admin.ch/en/health-insurance-premiums-and-co-payment","source_title":"BAG · Health insurance: premiums and co-payment","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:franquicias-orden","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_order":[1,3,2,0],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["a7b989e258920798d4e5853c4272cce5"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-wc-uso-normal-noche","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Necesitas usar normalmente el WC después de las 22:00. ¿Existe una prohibición federal general de tirar de la cisterna a esa hora?","options":["No; el uso normal del WC no está prohibido por una regla federal de las 22:00","Sí, siempre hay que esperar hasta las 07:00","Sí, excepto en viviendas en propiedad","Sí, salvo si vives en la planta baja"],"explanation":"El uso ordinario del WC no equivale a una molestia evitable como poner música fuerte. El horario de descanso exige consideración, pero no crea una prohibición federal general de usar la cisterna. El contraste sobre la cisterna es de SWI; la asociación de inquilinos explica los límites proporcionados de un reglamento.","sources":[{"id":"ch-wc-factcheck","url":"https://www.swissinfo.ch/ger/gesellschaft/faktencheck-quiz_koennen-sie-fragen-ueber-die-schweiz-richtig-beantworten/45449968","title":"SWI swissinfo.ch · Faktencheck: Toilettenspülung nach 22 Uhr","authority":"SWI swissinfo.ch / SRG SSR","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Darf man nach 22 Uhr ... Toilettenspülung ...?"},{"id":"ch-mv-neighbours","url":"https://www.mieterverband.ch/mietrecht/waehrend-der-miete/nachbarschaft-hausordnung/","title":"Mieterinnen- und Mieterverband · Nachbarschaft und Hausordnung","authority":"Mieterinnen- und Mieterverband","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Hausordnung; primeros pasos ante molestias"}],"source_url":"https://www.swissinfo.ch/ger/gesellschaft/faktencheck-quiz_koennen-sie-fragen-ueber-die-schweiz-richtig-beantworten/45449968","source_title":"SWI swissinfo.ch · Faktencheck: Toilettenspülung nach 22 Uhr","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:wc-uso-normal-noche","status":"published","source_classification":"specialist_and_public_service_factcheck","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0},"known":["403fb52306ae4cba0375f3b83247e4f6"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-grabar-charla-privada","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Discutes en persona con un vecino en una conversación privada. ¿Puedes grabarla a escondidas solo porque tú participas?","options":["No; participar no sustituye el consentimiento de las otras personas","Sí, participar permite grabar cualquier conversación privada","Sí, siempre que la grabación se quede en tu teléfono","Sí, si la utilizas únicamente para tu reclamación"],"explanation":"El PFPDT explica que grabar una conversación privada presencial exige el consentimiento de sus participantes. Hay excepciones específicas para determinadas conversaciones telefónicas, que no convierten este caso presencial en una grabación permitida.","sources":[{"id":"ch-conversation","url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/de/aufzeichnung-von-gespraechen","title":"PFPDT · Aufzeichnung von Gesprächen","authority":"Eidgenössischer Datenschutz- und Öffentlichkeitsbeauftragter","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Aufzeichnung von Nicht-Telefongesprächen; excepciones telefónicas"}],"source_url":"https://www.edoeb.admin.ch/de/aufzeichnung-von-gespraechen","source_title":"PFPDT · Aufzeichnung von Gesprächen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:grabar-charla-privada","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":0},"known":["749a236418f9c55564b598f0759de23b"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-ave-alarma-distancia","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Un ave con crías junto al lago da señales de alarma. Aún no hay contacto: ¿cómo reaccionas?","options":["Aumentar la distancia y dejarle espacio","Acercarte más para que se acostumbre","Bloquearle la salida para fotografiarla","Provocarla con sonidos de alarma"],"explanation":"La Vogelwarte recomienda alejarse cuando aparecen señales de alarma y respetar las zonas de cría. Aplicarlo a esta situación es una recomendación preventiva de observación; no es una interpretación de los límites legales de la defensa ante un ataque.","sources":[{"id":"ch-birds","url":"https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/ratgeber/verantwortungsvolles-beobachten-und-fotografieren-der-voegel/","title":"Vogelwarte · Verantwortungsvolles Beobachten und Fotografieren der Vögel","authority":"Schweizerische Vogelwarte Sempach","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Comportamiento ante aves en cría y señales de alarma"}],"source_url":"https://www.vogelwarte.ch/de/ratgeber/verantwortungsvolles-beobachten-und-fotografieren-der-voegel/","source_title":"Vogelwarte · Verantwortungsvolles Beobachten und Fotografieren der Vögel","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:ave-alarma-distancia","status":"published","editorial_inference":true,"editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["aa671907c37365256c4f76737b45a397"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-entrega-defecto-pequeno","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Al recibir las llaves detectas una pequeña grieta que ya estaba en la vivienda. ¿Qué te conviene hacer?","options":["Dejar constancia del defecto en el acta de entrega","Esperar al final del alquiler para mencionarlo","Firmar sin anotarlo si parece pequeño","Limitarte a comentarlo a otro vecino"],"explanation":"El acta de entrega permite documentar el estado inicial, incluidos defectos pequeños. Así se distingue lo que ya existía de los daños que puedan producirse durante tu alquiler.","sources":[{"id":"ch-bwo-rent","url":"https://www.bwo.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/HEHpEdcSGcG4/2024-Infoblatt-Spanisch.pdf","title":"BWO · Vivir en Suiza: información sobre el alquiler de viviendas","authority":"Bundesamt für Wohnungswesen","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Los protagonistas; solicitud; contrato; entrega; convivencia"}],"source_url":"https://www.bwo.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/HEHpEdcSGcG4/2024-Infoblatt-Spanisch.pdf","source_title":"BWO · Vivir en Suiza: información sobre el alquiler de viviendas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:entrega-defecto-pequeno","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["fc10c805458d8bacc721771f70418f57"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-solicitud-alquiler-tasa","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Presentas una solicitud de alquiler y después la retiras, sin haber firmado un contrato. ¿Qué indica la guía federal sobre cobrarte por tramitar o retirar esa solicitud?","options":["No deben cobrarte esas tasas por la solicitud","Hay una tasa federal fija por retirarla","Se debe pagar una mensualidad completa","Cualquier importe es válido si aparece en el formulario"],"explanation":"La guía del BWO señala que no deben cobrarse tasas por tramitar, reservar o retirar una solicitud. Este supuesto no trata de resolver un contrato de alquiler ya firmado.","sources":[{"id":"ch-bwo-rent","url":"https://www.bwo.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/HEHpEdcSGcG4/2024-Infoblatt-Spanisch.pdf","title":"BWO · Vivir en Suiza: información sobre el alquiler de viviendas","authority":"Bundesamt für Wohnungswesen","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Los protagonistas; solicitud; contrato; entrega; convivencia"}],"source_url":"https://www.bwo.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/HEHpEdcSGcG4/2024-Infoblatt-Spanisch.pdf","source_title":"BWO · Vivir en Suiza: información sobre el alquiler de viviendas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:solicitud-alquiler-tasa","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["86a5a337c89d8161ddadf773e95932af"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-confederacion-competencia","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"¿Cuáles de estas tareas corresponden al ámbito federal en la descripción del federalismo suizo?","options":["La política exterior","Gestionar la recogida domiciliaria de residuos de cada municipio","Elegir al conserje de cada inmueble de alquiler","Aprobar individualmente cada permiso municipal de construcción"],"explanation":"La Confederación asume, entre otras competencias, la política exterior. El reparto de tareas entre Confederación, cantones y municipios explica por qué no todos los trámites se realizan en la misma oficina.","sources":[{"id":"ch-fed","url":"https://www.ch-info.swiss/en/die-schweiz/foederalismus","title":"Cancillería Federal · Federalism","authority":"Schweizerische Bundeskanzlei","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Confederation, Cantons, Communes"}],"source_url":"https://www.ch-info.swiss/en/die-schweiz/foederalismus","source_title":"Cancillería Federal · Federalism","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:confederacion-competencia","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0],"correct_index":0},"known":["299fc5ec4f2bff10687d0c3eb3e7e95b"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-propina-voluntaria","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"En Suiza, dejar una propina adicional por un servicio es voluntario.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"Switzerland Tourism indica que la propina no es obligatoria. Puedes expresar satisfacción con una propina, pero no hay que confundirla con el importe que debes pagar según la cuenta.","sources":[{"id":"ch-currency","url":"https://www.myswitzerland.com/en-ch/planning/about-switzerland/general-facts/money-and-shopping/currency/","title":"Switzerland Tourism · Currency","authority":"Switzerland Tourism","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Currency; coins; banknotes; tipping"}],"source_url":"https://www.myswitzerland.com/en-ch/planning/about-switzerland/general-facts/money-and-shopping/currency/","source_title":"Switzerland Tourism · Currency","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:propina-voluntaria","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":0},"known":["3cf424e999bddefb187abc7f4d4f9c18"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-semaforo-stop-activo","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"movilidad","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"En un cruce con semáforos funcionando, el stop debe aplicarse como si no hubiera semáforos.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"El artículo 36.3 de la OSR indica que el stop y el ceda el paso se observan cuando el tráfico no está regulado por los semáforos. Aquí se plantea expresamente un semáforo que está funcionando y regulando la intersección.","sources":[{"id":"ch-ssv-2026","url":"https://www.fedlex.admin.ch/filestore/fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/1979/1961_1961_1961/20261001/fr/pdf-a/fedlex-data-admin-ch-eli-cc-1979-1961_1961_1961-20261001-fr-pdf-a.pdf","title":"OSR, état au 1er octobre 2026","authority":"Confédération suisse / Fedlex","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Art. 36, art. 37 et annexe 2, signaux 3.01–3.03"}],"source_url":"https://www.fedlex.admin.ch/filestore/fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/1979/1961_1961_1961/20261001/fr/pdf-a/fedlex-data-admin-ch-eli-cc-1979-1961_1961_1961-20261001-fr-pdf-a.pdf","source_title":"OSR, état au 1er octobre 2026","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:semaforo-stop-activo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["f04263d0e89ce863f2b724c30351d543"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-pet-leche-logo","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"Una botella de leche de PET con el logotipo de recogida correspondiente puede ir al reciclaje de botellas de PET.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"El BAFU incluye las botellas de leche de PET identificadas para este circuito. No todas las botellas de leche son de PET: las de PE se separan por otra vía.","sources":[{"id":"ch-pet-2026","url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/de/pet-getraenkeflaschen","title":"PET-Getränkeflaschen","authority":"Bundesamt für Umwelt BAFU","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Separatsammlung; PET-Milchflaschen"}],"source_url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/de/pet-getraenkeflaschen","source_title":"PET-Getränkeflaschen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:pet-leche-logo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["f5276b480466f79ebc39d97de2876544"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-regla-edificio-no-ley","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"El horario de lavandería de un edificio es una ley para todas las viviendas de Suiza.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"Un reglamento puede organizar un inmueble concreto. No convierte sus horarios en una norma nacional: hay que distinguir contrato, reglas del edificio y disposiciones cantonales o municipales.","sources":[{"id":"ch-rental","url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","authority":"Schweizerische Bundeskanzlei","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Concluding; What else; Disputes; Subletting"}],"source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","source_title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:regla-edificio-no-ley","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["978a76901b88ed88ebb32db974d99146"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-platos-significados","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"Relaciona cada plato con su descripción.","options":["Fondue","Rösti","Raclette","Birchermüesli"],"explanation":"Son platos asociados a la gastronomía suiza. Estas descripciones permiten reconocerlos; existen variantes regionales y de cada casa.","sources":[{"id":"ch-food","url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/switzerlands-national-dishes","title":"Switzerland’s national dishes","authority":"Federal Department of Foreign Affairs","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Fondue; Rösti; Raclette; Birchermüesli"}],"source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/switzerlands-national-dishes","source_title":"Switzerland’s national dishes","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:platos-significados","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"pairs":["Queso fundido en el que se moja pan","Preparación de patata rallada dorada","Queso calentado cuya parte fundida se sirve raspándola","Mezcla de avena y fruta con leche o yogur"],"correct_index":0},"known":["1f025365582f37d272e8509c318f040b"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-alquiler-personas-funciones","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"¿Quién hace qué en un alquiler? Une las parejas.","options":["Arrendado