-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"order","prompt":"Ordena estos hitos del Salmo suizo, del más antiguo al más reciente.","options":["Adopción definitiva como himno oficial","Composición del Salmo suizo","Adopción provisional como himno"],"explanation":"El Salmo suizo se compuso en 1841, se adoptó provisionalmente en 1961 y se convirtió en himno oficial en 1981.","sources":[{"id":"ch-anthem","url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/national-holiday-and-national-anthem","title":"National holiday and national anthem","authority":"Federal Department of Foreign Affairs","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Swiss Psalm; National Day"}],"source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/national-holiday-and-national-anthem","source_title":"National holiday and national anthem","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:himno-orden-historico","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"correct_order":[1,2,0],"correct_index":0},"known":["d922befddcd57e086f87ee993d1bcba0"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ch-monedas-orden-valor","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"order","prompt":"Ordena estas monedas suizas por su valor, de menor a mayor.","options":["2 francos","20 céntimos","5 francos","50 céntimos"],"explanation":"Cien céntimos equivalen a un franco: 20 céntimos, 50 céntimos, 2 francos y 5 francos. Se comparan importes y no el tamaño físico de las monedas.","sources":[{"id":"ch-currency","url":"https://www.myswitzerland.com/en-ch/planning/about-switzerland/general-facts/money-and-shopping/currency/","title":"Switzerland Tourism · Currency","authority":"Switzerland Tourism","checke